# already in the first person; the place now has a name and a direction
STORY['sm_hearts_of_zeal'] = ("I want to know what the Crusade puts in its faithful. The Scarlet Torturers and the Scarlet Scryers in the Monastery's Graveyard carry little vials of anointing oil, up in the Monastery north of here, in Eastern Tirisfal. I think there's more in it than oil. Bring me the vials, and I'll find out what makes a man burn his neighbours and sing while he does it. I've seen what they do with it, and I'd like to know how.", "The Torturers and the Scryers keep to the halls and the Chamber of Atonement in the Graveyard. Don't drink any of it.")
